  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "14466414",
      "title": "Switching Between Auth Modes",
      "lectureOrder": 614,
      "videoOrder": 566,
      "sourceHash": "6ea017b05df59aa4f4453b78f057e6f77a9b13ebc165706eb5d1b02b402a73a7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 5.13,
          "en": "Speaker: In order to switch between login and sign up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.13,
          "end": 7.68,
          "en": "in the auth component we need to manage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.68,
          "end": 9.6,
          "en": "the currently active mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.6,
          "end": 13.32,
          "en": "And therefore you could, for example add a property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.32,
          "end": 17.52,
          "en": "is login mode but you can name this whatever you want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.52,
          "end": 19.77,
          "en": "In the end, the idea here is that you store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.77,
          "end": 22.89,
          "en": "if the user is currently in login or in signup mode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.89,
          "end": 24.72,
          "en": "and you adjust the user interface,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.72,
          "end": 27.21,
          "en": "but also what you do when the form gets submitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.21,
          "end": 29.7,
          "en": "dynamically based on that property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.7,
          "end": 31.413,
          "en": "So initially that could be true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.31,
          "end": 35.79,
          "en": "And then I will add a method on switch mode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.79,
          "end": 36.9,
          "en": "which we can call",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.9,
          "end": 39.9,
          "en": "from our user interface to change that property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.9,
          "end": 41.91,
          "en": "This allows us to dynamically change what's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.91,
          "end": 44.4,
          "en": "on the user interface upon an event triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.4,
          "end": 47.61,
          "en": "by the user by using that helper property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.61,
          "end": 50.49,
          "en": "a pattern we used many times throughout the course already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.49,
          "end": 54.57,
          "en": "So in here we can set is login mode to false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.57,
          "end": 56.43,
          "en": "but that's actually not what I wanna do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.43,
          "end": 58.2,
          "en": "Instead, the idea here is that we change it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.2,
          "end": 60.57,
          "en": "to the opposite of what it was before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.57,
          "end": 63.15,
          "en": "and for that we can use a handy shortcut.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.15,
          "end": 66.75,
          "en": "We can change it to not, this is login mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.75,
          "end": 68.52,
          "en": "Whilst this might look strange at first,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.52,
          "end": 70.86,
          "en": "this simply reverses the value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.86,
          "end": 75.86,
          "en": "If this previously stored true, then not true will be false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.96000000000001,
          "end": 77.94,
          "en": "and therefore we now store false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 77.94,
          "end": 79.62,
          "en": "If this stored false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.62,
          "end": 82.38,
          "en": "then not false will be true and we now store true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 82.38,
          "end": 83.67,
          "en": "That's the idea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.67,
          "end": 85.92,
          "en": "Now we just have to connect on switch mode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.92,
          "end": 89.34,
          "en": "and this is login property in our template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 89.34,
          "end": 92.00999999999999,
          "en": "Now I wanna switch to mode when we click that button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 92.00999999999999,
          "end": 95.94,
          "en": "at the bottom, so here upon a click we can call",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.94,
          "end": 97.14,
          "en": "on switch mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 97.14,
          "end": 97.973,
          "en": "That's the idea,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 97.973,
          "end": 100.89,
          "en": "because that should be our trigger for switching the mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 100.89,
          "end": 102.69,
          "en": "But now of course we also need to adjust",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 102.69,
          "end": 106.14,
          "en": "the user interface based on the mode we are in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 106.14,
          "end": 109.77000000000001,
          "en": "The form inputs we show shouldn't change, let's say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 109.77000000000001,
          "end": 111.87299999999999,
          "en": "but the button labels certainly should.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 112.71000000000001,
          "end": 115.25999999999999,
          "en": "Here for example, will not always show signup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 115.25999999999999,
          "end": 117.69,
          "en": "but instead we can use string interpolation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 117.69,
          "end": 119.64,
          "en": "to show a dynamic text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 119.64,
          "end": 121.32,
          "en": "We can check is login mode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 121.32,
          "end": 123.27,
          "en": "which is the property we just added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 123.27,
          "end": 126.24,
          "en": "And if that is true, we know we are in login mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 126.24,
          "end": 129.21,
          "en": "So this button which is there to submit the forum",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 129.21,
          "end": 132.03,
          "en": "should actually display log in as a text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 132.03,
          "end": 133.95,
          "en": "And don't forget the single quotes here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 133.95,
          "end": 136.38,
          "en": "to really output text in there because you're",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 136.38,
          "end": 137.937,
          "en": "in the string interpolation, syntex.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 137.937,
          "end": 140.34,
          "en": "Hence, everything in there is interpreted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 140.34,
          "end": 142.38,
          "en": "as JavaScript code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 142.38,
          "end": 145.273,
          "en": "The alternative, and this is a ternary expression here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 145.273,
          "end": 147.54,
          "en": "with the question mark.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 147.54,
          "end": 150.39,
          "en": "Then the code we want to execute if this condition is true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 150.39,
          "end": 152.82,
          "en": "and then a colon and then the code we want to execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 152.82,
          "end": 154.74,
          "en": "if that condition is not true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 154.74,
          "end": 157.98,
          "en": "So if that is not true, then we are not in login mode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 157.98,
          "end": 160.62,
          "en": "and the offer I wanna output sign up because if we're not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 160.62,
          "end": 162.78300000000002,
          "en": "in login mode, we are in signup mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 163.74,
          "end": 166.02,
          "en": "A side note, by the way, as it just said",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 166.02,
          "end": 167.73,
          "en": "this button should submit the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 167.73,
          "end": 170.01,
          "en": "so we should change it to type submit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 170.01,
          "end": 172.68,
          "en": "The other button here, which switches modes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 172.68,
          "end": 175.65,
          "en": "should be changed to type button so that it doesn't",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 175.65,
          "end": 178.65,
          "en": "submit that form here because if you don't set a type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 178.65,
          "end": 180.39,
          "en": "clicking that button, which is inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 180.39,
          "end": 182.37,
          "en": "of the form will actually submit it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 182.37,
          "end": 184.74,
          "en": "and therefore if Angular doesn't step in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 184.74,
          "end": 188.16,
          "en": "it will send an unnecessary HTDP request into the void.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 188.16,
          "end": 191.19,
          "en": "And even if Angular steps in and prevents the submission,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 191.19,
          "end": 193.32,
          "en": "it will trigger the form submission in Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 193.32,
          "end": 195.45,
          "en": "Nonetheless, we certainly don't wanna do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 195.45,
          "end": 197.643,
          "en": "for this button only for the first one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 198.6,
          "end": 201.36,
          "en": "So now we have that first button changed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 201.36,
          "end": 202.74,
          "en": "the second button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 202.74,
          "end": 205.14,
          "en": "This text of course also has to change based",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 205.14,
          "end": 208.35,
          "en": "on the mode we're in because if we are in login mode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 208.35,
          "end": 210.39,
          "en": "then we can switch to signup mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 210.39,
          "end": 213.03,
          "en": "So in that case that we are in login mode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 213.03,
          "end": 215.01,
          "en": "we wanna say switch to signup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 215.01,
          "end": 218.52,
          "en": "If we're not in login mode, then we are in signup mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 218.52,
          "end": 220.41,
          "en": "And then here we should say switch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 220.41,
          "end": 223.173,
          "en": "to login because that is the mode we can switch to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 224.16,
          "end": 226.74,
          "en": "If you now save this and have a look.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 226.74,
          "end": 229.68,
          "en": "If I click this button now indeed correctly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 229.68,
          "end": 232.23,
          "en": "our user interface changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 232.23,
          "end": 235.07999999999998,
          "en": "So this is working and that's our first important step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 235.07999999999998,
          "end": 237.18,
          "en": "The next important step is of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 237.18,
          "end": 240.153,
          "en": "that we handle the form input here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
